      "lines": [
        "395. 如果：",
        "а) $x>5$； б) $x<-5$，",
        "那么两个等式 $|x-2|=x-2$ 或 $|x-2|=2-x$ 中，哪个等",
        "式是真等式？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "396",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "396. а) 已知 $s=\\frac{1}{2}ah$，用 $s$ 和 $a$ 表示变量 $h$；",
        "б) 已知 $\\frac{s}{p}=0.5m$，用 $s$ 和 $m$ 表示变量 $p$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "397",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "397. 当 $n$ 取哪些自然数值时，公式 $\\frac{9n^2+12n+12}{n}$ 的值是自",
        "然数？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "19. 较复杂的不等式解法举例"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们现在来研究怎样解不等式 $(ax+b)(cx+d)>0$，",
        "$(ax+b)(cx+d)<0$，$\\frac{ax+b}{cx+d}>0$，$\\frac{ax+b}{cx+d}<0$；其中 $a$、$b$、$c$、$d$",
        "是四个数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例1 解不等式 $(0.5x-1)(4-x)>0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "两个因式的积的值为正，当且仅当这两个因式的值同号，",
        "即两个因式的值同时为正或同时为负. 这就是说，原不等式",
        "是真不等式，必须并且只须变量 $x$ 所取的值满足下列不等式",
        "组之一：",
        "$\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}0.5x-1>0,\\\\↵4-x>0\\end{array}\\right.$ 或 $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}0.5x-1<0,\\\\4-x<0.\\end{array}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
